Release/

# Scratch, dumps and test fixtures. This rule lives here, in the tracked file, on purpose:
# it used to live only in .git/info/exclude, which is local to one working copy and is not
# inherited by any clone. The contents are exactly the things that must never ship
# (TestOnly_PlayerColonyXenotypes.xml among them), so the protection has to travel with
# the repo. tools\build-release.ps1's forbidden-content check is the second line of defence.
zzz-Do-Not-Commit/
__pycache__/